<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for creating an architectural design, including a pictorial representation intended to show how a building or other structure will look when completed."@en .
