<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50529> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/architectPersonOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to a work that involves a responsibility of a person for creating an architectural design, including a pictorial representation intended to show how a building or other structure will look when completed."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50529> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "architect person of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50529> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a person for creating an architectural design, including a pictorial representation intended to show how a building or other structure will look when completed."@en .
