<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is calligrapher collective agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/calligrapherCollectiveAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to a work that involves a responsibility of a collective agent for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same collective agent is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "calligrapher collective agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a collective agent for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same collective agent is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50687> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
