<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is calligrapher corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/calligrapherCorporateBodyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same corporate body is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "calligrapher corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same corporate body is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50838> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
