<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is calligrapher person of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/calligrapherPersonOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to a work that involves a responsibility of a person for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same person is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "calligrapher person of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a person for calligraphy where the focus of interest lies in the aesthetic value of the penmanship or graphic artistry, regardless of whether the same person is also responsible for the inscribed text."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50536> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
