<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to an expression that includes a contribution by a family of revising the content of another expression for the purpose of suppressing content that is deemed objectionable on moral, political, military, or other grounds, but leaving the nature and general content substantially unchanged."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51066> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "censor family of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51066> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a family of revising the content of another expression for the purpose of suppressing content that is deemed objectionable on moral, political, military, or other grounds, but leaving the nature and general content substantially unchanged."@en .
