<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a manifestation that involves a responsibility of an agent for preparing a hardened film of gelatin or other colloid that has ink-receptive and ink-repellent surfaces and that is used to make prints using a photomechanical process."@en .
