<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50266> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by an agent of applying colour to drawings, prints, photographs, maps, moving images, and other visual content."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50266> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/instructionNumber> "18.5" .
