<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to a nomen that is an appellation of family that consists of a code, number, or other string, usually independent of natural language and social naming conventions, used to identify a family."@en .
