<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is director corporate body of photography of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/directorCorporateBodyOfPhotographyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "director corporate body of photography of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10005> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50839> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
