<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to a work that involves a responsibility of a family for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
