<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50990> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a family for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
