<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is director person of photography of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/directorPersonOfPhotographyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to a work that involves a responsibility of a person for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "director person of photography of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of a person for capturing images, either electronically or on film or video stock, and often selecting and arranging the lighting."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50537> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
