<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an expression that includes a contribution by an agent of assembling, arranging, and trimming film, video, or other moving image formats, including both visual and audio aspects."@en .
