<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "agent col·lectiu editor de text de"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "……的文本的编者集体行为者"@zh-Hans-CN .
