<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50289> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is editorial director agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50289> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/editorialDirectorAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50289> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10002> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50289> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "editorial director agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50289> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a legal or intellectual responsibility, but not creative responsibility, of an agent for the editorial policy and content of a diachronic work."@en .
