<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is filmmaker agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a work that involves a responsibility of an agent for creating an independent or personal film."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A filmmaker is individually responsible for the conception and execution of all aspects of the film."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10002> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50204> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/filmmakerAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "est un agent cinéaste de"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Met un agent en relation avec une œuvre qui comporte une responsabilité de la part d’un agent consistant à créer un film indépendant ou personnel."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Un cinéaste est responsable à titre individuel de la conception et de l’exécution de tous les aspects du film."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agent cinéaste de"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Œuvre qui comporte une responsabilité de la part d’un agent consistant à créer un film indépendant ou personnel."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "filmmaker agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A work that involves a responsibility of an agent for creating an independent or personal film."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/instructionNumber> "18.5" .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "είναι σκηνοθέτης φορέας του"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Συνδέει έναν φορέα υπεύθυνο για τη δημιουργία ενός ανεξάρτητου ή προσωπικού φιλμ, με ένα έργο."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Ένας σκηνοθέτης είναι ατομικά υπεύθυνος για τη σύλληψη και την εκτέλεση όλων των πτυχών μιας ταινίας."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "σκηνοθέτης φορέας του"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Ένα έργο που περιλαμβάνει την ευθύνη της δημιουργίας ενός ανεξάρτητου ή προσωπικού φιλμ."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt einen Akteur in Beziehung zu einem Werk, bei dem ein Akteur für die Schaffung eines unabhängigen oder privaten Films verantwortlich ist."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Eine Filmemacherin/Ein Filmemacher ist persönlich für das Konzept und die Ausführung aller Aspekte des Films verantwortlich."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "Akteur als Filmemacherin/Filmemacher von"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Ein Werk, bei dem ein Akteur für die Schaffung eines unabhängigen oder privaten Films verantwortlich ist."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er agent, som er filmskaber af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en agent til et værk, som involverer en agents ansvar for at skabe en indiefilm eller personlig film."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Filmskaberen er individuelt ansvarlig for udtænkning og udførelse af alle filmens aspekter."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agent, som er filmskaber af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Værk, som involverer en agents ansvar for en indiefilm eller personlig film."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "és agent cineasta de"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona un agent amb una obra que implica una responsabilitat d’un agent en la creació d’una pel·lícula cinematogràfica independent o personal."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agent cineasta de"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Obra que implica una responsabilitat d’un agent en la creació d’una pel·lícula cinematogràfica independent o personal."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liittää toimijan teokseen, jossa toimija on vastuussa riippumattoman tai henkilökohtaisen elokuvan luomisesta."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Tekijä vastaa itse kaikilta osin elokuvan ideoinnista ja toteuttamisesta."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "elokuvantekijä (toimija) teoksessa"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Teos, jossa toimija on vastuussa riippumattoman tai henkilökohtaisen elokuvan luomisesta."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "filmskaper av (agent)"@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Et verk som involverer ansvar for en agent i form av å skape en uavhengig eller personlig film."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ist Akteur als Filmemacherin/Filmemacher von"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "filmkészítő ágense a következőnek:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Hozzákapcsol egy ágenst egy műhöz, amelyhez hozzátartozik egy ágens felelőssége egy független- vagy magánfilm létrehozásáért."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Egy filmkészítő egyénileg felelős egy film koncepciójáért és összes aspektusának végrehajtásáért."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "filmkészítő ágense:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Egy mű, amelyhez hozzátartozik egy ágens felelőssége egy független- vagy magánfilm létrehozásáért."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "filmmaker of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "elokuvantekijänä teoksessa"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elokuvantekijä (toimija) teoksessa"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er filmskaper av (agent)"@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en agent til et verk som involverer ansvar for en agent i form av å skape en uavhengig eller personlig film."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "En filmskaper er personlig ansvarlig for idéen og gjennomføringen av alle aspektene ved en film."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "filmskaper av"@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is filmmaker-actor van"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relateert een actor aan een werk dat met zich meebrengt een verantwoordelijkheid van een actor voor het creëren van een zelfstandige of persoonlijke film."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Een filmmaker is zelf verantwoordelijk voor het idee en de uitvoering van alle aspecten van de film."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "filmmaker-actor van"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Een werk dat met zich meebrengt een verantwoordelijkheid van een actor voor het creëren van een zelfstandige of persoonlijke film."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "هو وكيل صانع أفلام لـ"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "يربط وكيلا بعمل يترتب عليه مسئولية وكيل عن فيلم مستقل أو شخصي."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "صانع الفيلم هو المسئول مسئولية فردية عن تصور جميع جوانب الفيلم وتنفيذها."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "صانع أفلام"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "وكيل صانع أفلام"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "عمل يترتب عليه مسئولية وكيل عن فيلم مستقل أو شخصي."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Un cineasta és responsable a títol individual de la concepció i l’execució de tots els aspectes de la pel·lícula."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "cineasta de"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "filmskaber af"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "filmitegija (tegija) teoses"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Seostab tegija teosega, mis sisaldab tegija vastutust sõltumatu või autorifilmi eest."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Filmitegija vastutab üksinda kõigi filmi aspektide kontseptsiooni ja teostamise eest."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "filmitegija teoses"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "filmitegija (tegija) teoses"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Teos, mis sisaldab tegija vastutust sõltumatu või autorifilmi eest."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "filmkészítője:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è regista cinematografico agente di"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Correla un agente a un'opera che implica la responsabilità di un agente per un film indipendente o personale."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Un regista è individualmente responsabile del concepimento e dell'esecuzione di tutti gli aspetti del film."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "regista cinematografico di"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "regista cinematografico agente di"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Opera che implica la responsabilità di un agente  per un film indipendente o personale."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "σκηνοθέτης του"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "cinéaste de"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ir filmas veidotājs (aģents)"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sasaista aģentu ar darbu, kas ietver aģenta atbildību par neatkarīgas vai privātas filmas veidošanu un izpildi visos aspektos."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Filmas veidotājs ir pilnībā atbildīgs par visiem filmas koncepcijas un realizācijas aspektiem."@lv .
