<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is production company of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility for managing the financial, technical, and organizational aspects of a production for stage, screen, sound recording, television, webcast, etc."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50005> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
