<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50384> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has identifier for collective agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50384> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/identifierForCollectiveAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to a nomen that is an appellation of collective agent that consists of a code, number, or other string, usually independent of natural language and social naming conventions, used to identify a collective agent."@en .
