<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50384> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A nomen that is an appellation of collective agent that consists of a code, number, or other string, usually independent of natural language and social naming conventions, used to identify a collective agent."@en .
