<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a work that involves a responsibility of an agent for responding to an interviewer, usually a reporter, pollster, or some other kind of agent who gathers information."@en .
