<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50876> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is interviewee corporate body of expression of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50876> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/intervieweeCorporateBodyOfExpressionOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of being interviewed, usually by a reporter or some other kind of agent who gathers information."@en .
