<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50876> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of being interviewed, usually by a reporter or some other kind of agent who gathers information."@en .
