<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for responding to an interviewer, usually a reporter, pollster, or some other kind of agent who gathers information."@en .
