<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "est une famille interviewée d’une expression de"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Met une famille en relation avec une expression qui intègre une contribution de la part d’une famille consistant à être interviewé, habituellement par un reporteur ou un autre type d’agent recueillant de l’information."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "famille interviewée d’une expression de"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Expression qui intègre une contribution de la part d’une famille consistant à être interviewé, habituellement par un reporteur ou un autre type d’agent recueillant de l’information."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ir intervējamais (dzimta/ģimene) izteiksmē"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sasaista dzimtu/ģimeni ar izteiksmi, kas ietver dzimtas/ģimenes ieguldījumu, atbildot uz intervētāja, parasti reportiera, aptaujas organizētāja vai kāda cita informācijas apkopotāja jautājumiem."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "ir intervējamais (dzimta/ģimene) izteiksmē"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Izteiksme, kas ietver dzimtas/ģimenes ieguldījumu, atbildot uz intervētāja, parasti reportiera, aptaujas organizētāja vai kāda cita informācijas apkopotāja jautājumiem."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "是……的内容表达的受访者家族"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一个家族与包括一个被采访（通常由记者或其他某种信息收集的行为者）的一个家族的贡献的一种内容表达关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "……的内容表达的受访者家族"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "包括一个被采访（通常由记者或其他某种信息收集的行为者）的一个家族的贡献的一种内容表达"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "anlatımının görüşülen ailesidir"@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Bir aileyi, genellikle bir muhabir veya bilgi toplayan başka tür bir aracı tarafından röportaj yapılan bir ailenin katkısını içeren bir anlatımla ilişkilendirir."@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "anlatımının görüşülen ailesidir"@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Genellikle bir muhabir veya bilgi toplayan başka bir tür temsilci tarafından röportaj yapılmasına bir ailenin katkıda bulunmasını içeren bir anlatım."@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "es familia entrevistada de expresión de"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona una familia con una expresión que involucra una responsabilidad de una familia de responder a un entrevistador, comúnmente un reportero, encuestador u otro tipo de familia que recolecta información."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51027> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "familia entrevistada de expresión de"@es .
