<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50684> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/lyricistCollectiveAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to a work that involves a responsibility of a collective agent for authoring the words of a popular song, including a song from a musical."@en .
