<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50260> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "otro lugar asociado con la entidad corporativa"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50260> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Un lugar asociado con una entidad corporativa diferente al lugar de una conferencia, etc."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Other place associated with corporate body includes a country, state, province, local place, etc., associated with a corporate body and the location of headquarters of a corporate body."@en .
