<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an expression that includes a contribution by an agent of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Remixing activities that substantially change the nature and content of the original work, resulting in a new work, are excluded."@en .
