<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50297> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by an agent of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
