<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50748> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/mixingEngineerCollectiveAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to an expression that includes a contribution by a collective agent of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
