<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50748> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10011> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50748> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
