<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is mixing engineer corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/mixingEngineerCorporateBodyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "mixing engineer corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10005> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50899> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
