<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50597> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a person of manipulating, mixing and assembling the multiple tracks of an audio recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50597> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50597> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10004> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50597> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
