<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50076> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50076> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50076> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is moderator agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an expression that includes a contribution by an agent of leading a program, often broadcast, where topics are discussed, usually with participation of experts in fields related to the discussion."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50076> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
