<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to an expression that includes a contribution by a collective agent of leading a program, often broadcast, where topics are discussed, usually with participation of experts in fields related to the discussion."@en .
