<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to an expression that includes a contribution by a collective agent of coordinating the activities of composers, sound editors, and sound mixers for a moving image production or for a musical or dramatic presentation or entertainment."@en .
