<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to an expression that includes a contribution by a family of appearing on screen to provide contextual or background information."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51023> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "onscreen presenter family of"@en .
