<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50270> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50270> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is organizer agent of"@en .
