<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50777> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/presenterCollectiveAgentOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to an expression that is embodied in a manifestation that includes a statement of an \"X presents:\" credit for a collective agent who is probably associated with production, finance, or distribution of an expression of a moving image work in some way."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50777> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "presenter collective agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50777> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that is embodied in a manifestation that includes a statement of an \"X presents:\" credit for a collective agent who is probably associated with production, finance, or distribution of an expression of a moving image work in some way."@en .
