<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an expression that is embodied in a manifestation that includes a statement of an \"X presents:\" credit for a corporate body who is probably associated with production, finance, or distribution of an expression of a moving image work in some way."@en .
