<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50179> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50179> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50179> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is printer agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to a manifestation that involves a responsibility of an agent for manufacturing a printed manifestation that embodies text, notated music, cartographic content, notated movement, or still image content using a device that transfers ink or a similar medium to a surface."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50179> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
