<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work that involves a responsibility of a corporate body for most of the business aspects of a production for screen, sound recording, television, webcast, etc."@en .
