<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a collective agent to an expression that includes a contribution by a collective agent of restoring or combining expressions, which may be damaged or fragmentary, to create a new expression."@en .
