<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an item that involves a responsibility by a corporate body for compensation of degradation by bringing it back to a state as close as possible to its original condition using a set of technical, editorial, and intellectual procedures."@en .
