<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51082> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/restorationistFamilyOfItemOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to an item that involves a responsibility by a family for compensation of degradation by bringing it back to a state as close as possible to its original condition using a set of technical, editorial, and intellectual procedures."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51082> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "restorationist family of item of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51082> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An item that involves a responsibility of a family for compensation of degradation by bringing it back to a state as close as possible to its original condition using a set of technical, editorial, and intellectual procedures."@en .
