<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50629> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/restorationistPersonOfItemOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to an item that involves a responsibility by a person for compensation of degradation by bringing it back to a state as close as possible to its original condition using a set of technical, editorial, and intellectual procedures."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50629> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "restorationist person of item of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50629> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An item that involves a responsibility of a person for compensation of degradation by bringing it back to a state as close as possible to its original condition using a set of technical, editorial, and intellectual procedures."@en .
