<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body who uses their voice, with or without instrumental accompaniment, to produce music."@en .
