<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an expression that includes a contribution by an agent of writing down or notating previously unwritten or unnotated content, or by changing it from one system of notation to another."@en .
