<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is translator corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/translatorCorporateBodyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to an expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "translator corporate body of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a corporate body of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10005> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50887> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "2" .
