<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51038> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/translatorFamilyOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a family to an expression that includes a contribution by a family of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51038> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "translator family of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P51038> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a family of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
