<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is translator person of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/translatorPersonOf.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to an expression that includes a contribution by a person of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "translator person of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An expression that includes a contribution by a person of expressing the linguistic content of the work in a different language."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50585> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
