<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50217> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50217> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is voice actor agent of"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an agent to an expression that includes a contribution by an agent of providing the voice for characters in radio and audio productions and for animated characters in moving image works, as well as voice-overs in radio and television commercials, dubbed expressions, etc."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50217> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
